 not emitted while loading, or when the page is the current one or out of range. ",[306,342,343],{},"interactionDisabled"," is ",[306,346,347],{},"true"," while loading and can be used to disable actions in the list.",[350,351],"component-example",{"name":352},"list-card-basic",[296,354,355,356,359,360,363,364,367,368,372],{},"The ",[306,357,358],{},"PageRequest"," type can be imported from ",[306,361,362],{},"#shuo-ui\u002Ftypes\u002Fpagination","; see ",[300,365,72],{"href":366},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Fadvanced\u002Fauto-imports#types",". For the full pattern with query fields, see ",[300,369,371],{"href":370},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Flayout\u002Fquery-card#with-listcard","With ListCard"," on ShuoQueryCard.",[322,374,376],{"id":375},"title-and-icon","Title and icon",[296,378,379,382,383,386,387,363,390,394],{},[306,380,381],{},"title"," is the title text and ",[306,384,385],{},"icon"," is the icon to the left of the title; pass an empty string to hide the icon. The title bar wraps by the same rules as ",[306,388,389],{},"ShuoQueryCard",[300,391,393],{"href":392},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Flayout\u002Fquery-card#long-titles","Long titles",".",[350,396],{"name":397},"list-card-title",[322,399,401],{"id":400},"pagination-and-counts","Pagination and counts",[296,403,404,407,408,411,412,415],{},[306,405,406],{},"show-pagination"," controls the pagination at the bottom left, shown even with a single page; ",[306,409,410],{},"show-summary"," controls the count and range at the bottom right; ",[306,413,414],{},"page-size"," is the number of rows per page, 10 by default.",[350,417],{"name":418},"list-card-footer",[420,421,422,436],"ul",{},[423,424,425,426,428,429,363,432,394],"li",{},"After changing ",[306,427,414],{},", query again from the first page with ",[306,430,431],{},"getPagination(1)",[300,433,435],{"href":434},"#re-querying-the-current-page","Re-querying the current page",[423,437,438,439,442,443,445],{},"When both pagination and the summary are off, the bottom on